        "execSummary":  "Anthropic\u0027s recalibration of Fable 5\u0027s biology guardrails is a sign of maturing AI safety practice: moving from blunt over-refusal toward surgical, empirically-tested restrictions. For enterprise buyers in life sciences, healthcare, and pharma, this is a meaningful unlockΓÇöclinical and research teams can now use Claude for a wider range of legitimate scientific tasks without workarounds. It also demonstrates that safety and utility are not permanently at odds, which matters when building business cases for AI adoption in risk-sensitive industries. Leaders should verify with Anthropic which specific use cases are now permitted before updating internal policies.",
