        "execSummary":  "This partnership signals that major systems integrators are now building their core delivery platforms on top of Claude, which accelerates enterprise access without requiring in-house AI engineering. For senior leaders, the 40% reduction in contract review time and eight-hours-per-week underwriter savings are credible benchmark numbers to pressure-test against internal automation initiatives. Organizations considering AI at scale should evaluate whether partnering through a Cognizant-style integrator is faster than direct API adoption, particularly where industry-specific context and change management are the real bottlenecks. The breadth of sectors coveredΓÇömanufacturing, life sciences, insuranceΓÇösuggests this playbook is being designed for broad replication.",
