        "execSummary":  "Claude Opus 5 sets a new capability ceiling for Anthropic\u0027s model family and, critically, does so at a price point aimed at enterprise production useΓÇönot just benchmarking. For AI leaders evaluating foundation model vendors, this resets the comparison matrix against GPT-series and Gemini Ultra models and warrants a fresh evaluation cycle. Organizations already using earlier Claude models for coding, research, or knowledge work should pilot Opus 5 for their highest-value, highest-complexity workflows where accuracy gains justify the cost. The combined release of Opus 5 and the Cognizant partnership in the same week signals Anthropic is accelerating its enterprise go-to-market in 2026.",
