        "summary":  "This guide explains how to extend Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Observability to AI agents running outside AWS, including on-premises and on Google Cloud Platform. The solution uses AWS Distro for OpenTelemetry with IAM SigV4 signing to route telemetryΓÇösessions, traces, spans, and token usageΓÇöinto the AgentCore dashboard. Validation confirms identical metrics regardless of where the agent is deployed.",
