        "summary":  "This article presents a reference architecture for automating legacy web applications using Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Browser Tool and Strands Agents, addressing the brittleness of traditional RPA. Vision-capable foundation models analyze screenshots and determine next actions within secure, isolated browser sessions, with human-in-the-loop safeguards for critical steps. The full deployment uses Terraform, Cognito, Fargate, CloudFront, and S3 for session recording and audit trails.",
