        "source":  "NVIDIA AI Blog",
        "url":  "https://blogs.nvidia.com/blog/nemotron-lightning-switchyard-rtx-dgx/",
        "date":  "2026-08-11",
        "theme":  "Agents",
        "summary":  "NVIDIA released Nemotron 3.5 Lightning, a 30B mixture-of-experts model delivering up to 4x faster token generation and 30% faster agentic task completion compared to models in its class. Alongside it, NeMo Switchyard is an open-source routing library that intelligently directs inference requests to the most suitable model across heterogeneous environments. Together they enable enterprises to build cost-optimized, task-specific agentic AI pipelines spanning edge, workstation, data center, and cloud.",
