        "theme":  "Agents",
        "summary":  "A Deloitte survey finds most enterprises are three to four years away from redesigning half their business processes around AI agents, with only 15% having successfully scaled multiagent systems to date. Organizations are currently layering agents onto existing workflows rather than rearchitecting processes from the ground up, limiting the value they can extract. Barriers include weak data foundations, governance gaps, integration complexity, and workforce readiness shortfalls.",
